<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 14.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, FEB 14.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixingrates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Friday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Feb 14	Feb 13     Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  263.730     262.700     247.020    6.76 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.890     303.970     306.830   -0.96 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.440     156.140     158.970   -1.59 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.360	46.242	47.182   -1.74 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  427.080     428.060     419.180    1.88 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  139.395     139.170     141.685   -1.62 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.858	15.884	16.185   -2.02 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  212.730     211.680     212.430    0.14 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.848	 1.843	 1.888   -2.12 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.556	 1.552	 1.581   -1.58 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  180.555     181.535     183.135   -1.41 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Margarita Sotiropoulou, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
